            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.briefing_mode.none" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.briefing_mode.none">
                <source>Skip — no questions before generation</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.briefing_mode.optional" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.briefing_mode.optional">
                <source>Optional — editors may skip the questionnaire</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.briefing_mode.required" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.briefing_mode.required">
                <source>Required — editors must answer before generating</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.publish_mode" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.publish_mode">
                <source>Page Visibility</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.publish_mode.hidden" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.publish_mode.hidden">
                <source>Hidden — review before publishing</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.publish_mode.visible" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.publish_mode.visible">
                <source>Visible — publish immediately</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.be_groups" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.be_groups">
                <source>Allowed Editor Groups</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.title.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.title.description">
                <source>Name shown to editors when selecting this template in the wizard.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.identifier.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.identifier.description">
                <source>Auto-generated technical slug. Used internally — no need to change.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.description.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.description.description">
                <source>Brief explanation of what this template creates. Editors see this in the wizard to help choose the right template.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.llm_configuration.default" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.llm_configuration.default">
                <source>-- Use Default --</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.llm_configuration.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.llm_configuration.description">
                <source>Which AI model generates the content. Leave on "Default" to use the globally configured model.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.system_prompt.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.system_prompt.description">
                <source>Instructions that tell the AI how to write: tone, style, length, language, and constraints. Example: "Write in formal German, max 200 words per section, include a call-to-action." Tip: Use "Auto-optimize" to generate instructions from your template settings, or "Preview" to test the full output.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.allowed_ctypes.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.allowed_ctypes.description">
                <source>Which content elements the AI may use on the page (e.g. text, image, header). Only checked types will appear in generated pages.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.page_fields.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.page_fields.description">
                <source>Page properties the AI should fill in automatically (e.g. SEO title, meta description, Open Graph). Editors can review and adjust these in the wizard.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.reference_pages.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.reference_pages.description">
                <source>Select existing pages as examples. The AI analyzes their structure and content style to produce a similar result.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.briefing_mode.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.briefing_mode.description">
                <source>Should editors answer questions about the page topic before content is generated? A briefing helps the AI produce more targeted content.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.publish_mode.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.publish_mode.description">
                <source>Whether the generated page is hidden (for editorial review) or immediately visible on the website.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.be_groups.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.be_groups.description">
                <source>Restrict this template to specific editor groups. Leave empty to make it available to everyone.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.backend_layout" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.backend_layout">
                <source>Page Layout</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.backend_layout.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.backend_layout.description">
                <source>Layout for generated pages. Determines which content columns are available (e.g. main, sidebar, footer).</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.backend_layout.none" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.backend_layout.none">
                <source>-- Inherit from parent page --</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.content_columns" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.content_columns">
                <source>Content Columns</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.content_columns.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.content_columns.description">
                <source>Select which layout columns should be filled with generated content. Leave empty to use all columns.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.image_task" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.image_task">
                <source>Image Source</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.image_task.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.image_task.description">
                <source>How to find images for the page. "Media Library only" searches existing files. With an AI task selected, missing images are generated automatically.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.image_task.none" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.image_task.none">
                <source>-- Media Library only (no AI) --</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.prompt_optimizer_context" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.prompt_optimizer_context">
                <source>Optimization Context</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.prompt_optimizer_context.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.prompt_optimizer_context.description">
                <source>Background information used when auto-optimizing: brand guidelines, target audience, tone of voice. The optimizer combines this with your content types, page fields, and example pages to generate tailored AI instructions.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.prompt_optimizer_meta_prompt" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.prompt_optimizer_meta_prompt">
                <source>Optimization Strategy</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.prompt_optimizer_meta_prompt.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.prompt_optimizer_meta_prompt.description">
                <source>Advanced: Override how the AI optimizes your instructions. Leave empty to use the built-in strategy. Only change this if the default optimization doesn't fit your needs.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.generation_mode" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.generation_mode">
                <source>Generation Mode</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.generation_mode.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.generation_mode.description">
                <source>How the AI creates page content. "Structured" uses TYPO3 content elements (text, image, etc.). "Creative HTML" gives the AI full design freedom with HTML and CSS per layout block — ideal for visually rich, unique landing pages.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.generation_mode.structured" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.generation_mode.structured">
                <source>Structured — TYPO3 content elements</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.generation_mode.creative" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.generation_mode.creative">
                <source>Creative HTML — free design with HTML, CSS &amp; inline SVG</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tabs.ai" resname="tabs.ai">
                <source>AI Configuration</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tabs.content_layout" resname="tabs.content_layout">
                <source>Content &amp; Layout</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tabs.wizard" resname="tabs.wizard">
                <source>Wizard</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tabs.access" resname="tabs.access">
                <source>Access</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="palette.prompt_optimizer" resname="palette.prompt_optimizer">
                <source>Prompt Optimization</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="palette.color_scheme" resname="palette.color_scheme">
                <source>Color Scheme</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.animation_enabled" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.animation_enabled">
                <source>Animation</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.animation_enabled.label" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.animation_enabled.label">
                <source>Enable GSAP animations (scroll effects, typewriter, parallax)</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.animation_enabled.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.animation_enabled.description">
                <source>When enabled, GSAP-powered animations are injected into the generated page: scroll-triggered reveal effects, typewriter headlines, and parallax backgrounds.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color.placeholder" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color.placeholder">
                <source>Inherited from site settings</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_primary" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_primary">
                <source>Primary Color</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_primary.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_primary.description">
                <source>Main brand color used for buttons, links, and call-to-action elements. Leave empty to inherit from site settings.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_secondary" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_secondary">
                <source>Secondary Color</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_secondary.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_secondary.description">
                <source>Accent color for highlights, hover states, and decorative elements. Leave empty to inherit from site settings.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_background" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_background">
                <source>Background Color</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_background.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_background.description">
                <source>Default page and section background color. Leave empty to inherit from site settings.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_text" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_text">
                <source>Text Color</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_text.description" resname="tx_nrlandingpage_domain_model_template.color_text.description">
                <source>Default color for body text and paragraphs. Leave empty to inherit from site settings.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldInformation.generatedPageCount" resname="fieldInformation.generatedPageCount">
                <source>%d page(s) generated with this template</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldInformation.promptTools.optimize.title" resname="fieldInformation.promptTools.optimize.title">
                <source>Auto-optimize</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldInformation.promptTools.optimize.description" resname="fieldInformation.promptTools.optimize.description">
                <source>Analyzes your template settings (content types, page fields, example pages, layout) and generates optimized AI instructions. Replaces the current prompt text.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldInformation.promptTools.preview.title" resname="fieldInformation.promptTools.preview.title">
                <source>Preview</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldInformation.promptTools.preview.description" resname="fieldInformation.promptTools.preview.description">
                <source>Runs a full test generation with a sample topic. Shows the resulting content sections and matched images without creating a page. Use this to verify your prompt produces good results.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldControl.optimizePrompt" resname="fieldControl.optimizePrompt">
                <source>Auto-optimize — Generate AI instructions based on your template settings</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldControl.testGenerate" resname="fieldControl.testGenerate">
                <source>Preview — Simulate a full page generation with content and images</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.confirm.title" resname="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.confirm.title">
                <source>Generate Optimized AI Instructions</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.confirm.message" resname="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.confirm.message">
                <source>The AI will analyze your template configuration (content types, page fields, example pages, layout, and optimization context) and generate optimized instructions. This replaces the current text. Continue?</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.running" resname="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.running">
                <source>Optimizing instructions…</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.success" resname="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.success">
                <source>Instructions optimized</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.error" resname="fieldControl.optimizePrompt.error">
                <source>Optimization failed</source>
            </trans-unit>
        </body>
